---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Security | TritonAI Harness" description="Report a TritonAI Harness security issue.">
  <main class="container">
    <h1>TritonAI Harness security</h1>
    <p>Report vulnerabilities affecting TritonAI Harness to <a href="mailto:tritonai@ucsd.edu">tritonai@ucsd.edu</a>. Allow the maintainers time to investigate before public disclosure.</p>
    <p>Include the affected version, reproduction steps, and impact. Remove credentials and private campus information from evidence.</p>
    <p>For upstream T3 Code or T3 Tools-operated services, use the <a href="https://t3.codes/security-policy">upstream security policy</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
